@node no1 " Introduction"

This Door can protect your BBS for undesirable New User Accounts.
Build this in and have no dead Accounts in your BBS...
This is a 100% Protection for you...

I run this Door since Month successfull, and No Lamer have ever seen
any Ascii from my BBS...

have phun with the door...
[-Dr.Dre!/tRSi]

@endnode
@node no2 " Requirements"

You need an Amiga 500/1000/2000/3000 (The Sysops with an A4ooo or A12oo 
should call my BBS to receive an uncompiled Version)
Kickstart 2.0 or higher
Ami Express 2.xx - 3.xx (Registered)
An running RPStart
rexxplsextnd.library
Rexxplslib.library
rexxsyslib.library
rexxsupport.library
in your Libs: but they are included

Thats all...

@endnode
@node no3 " Installation"

First copy all Libs: (If you dont have them allready) into your libs: Dir
Copy the Quest.info to your bbs/commands/SysCmd/
and the NupCom.Info to your BBS:Commands/bbscmd/
and make shure you run rpstart in your Startup-Sequence.
Then create a Directory called LogoSnap in your Doors...
There you copy all Files and Dirs from the Archive Directory 
BBS/Doors/NupCom/

There must be in all this Files and Dirs...

Users                        Dir (Directory for the New Usersanswers)
ValUsers                     Dir (Directory for already Validated Users)
Nup-Comment.AiM            54096 (The New User Script Door)
Nupo.AiM                   96064 (The Nup Comment Server)
NuPCom.cfg                  1402 (The Script
Name.Access                   16 (Access File for the Server)
Name.no                    empty (Names not accepted in your BBS)
Name.in                    empty (New User Data File)
Name.val                   empty (Conatin File for Validated Users)
NuPCom.help                  799 (Help File for the NupCom Script)

-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Edit the Name.Access File in your Editor.
--------------------Cut Here--------------------
Sysop_Name
Cosysop_Name.1
Cosysop_Name.2
--------------------Cut Here--------------------
Write here the Names down from all Dudes you wish to have Access to the
Nup COm Server...
-----------------------------------------------------------------------



-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Edit the Name.no File in your Editor.
--------------------Cut Here--------------------
Name.1
Name.2
Name.3
--------------------Cut Here--------------------
Write here all Names down you dont wish to login your BBS as Newuser.
If the User comes in, then he will receive a funny message and will kicked
out your BBS...
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

-----------------------------------------------------------------------
No Edit the Nupcom.cfg
This is the NewUser Script... here you can ask the NewUser many stupid
Questions and you can decide then about him. let him in or not...
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Symbol Definitions:
-------------------
# Display Line only
* Normal Question
! Question which must Answered
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Example...

#If you will receive Access here so you have to Answer all Questions !
^All Lines with this Sign at the first Char want only displayed...

#Enter some Lines about your self...
!1:
*2:
*3:
The Line with the "!" at the first Char must be answered by the user...
No Accepting from empty Lines or spaces...
The Lines with the "*" at the first Char can answered but dont must...
Easy or not.... 
There are 2 example scripts includet...
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

The load your NewUserpw.txt(gr) into your Editor...
Build the Script into the Text with an MCI Command...
----------------Cut here-----------------
~
~f

      This BBS is a PRIVATE SYSTEM. Only private citizens who are not
 involved in government or law enforcement activities are authorized to use
  it. The users are not authorized to divulge any information gained from
   this system to any government or law enforcement agency or employee.
   No person is to violate FCC, copyright, or other lawful regulations.
 All data that is received is assumed within the Public Domain. Should anyone
    advise us to the contrary, we will investigate and remove materials
 not compatible with these regulations and is our sole extent of liability.
        Again; access to this system by ANY law enforcement agency
  (Federal, State, Local or other), software company, telephone company,
 government agency, or anyone affiliated with the above is not allowed. This
 is a private system; the above rules are in place to assure members rights
   are not violated.  Dove hai trovato questo numero? (MOLTO importante)
   If you agree to the above rules then you are here on the right Place!

~CC_NUP ;<- Note the Space after th MCI Command
----------------Cut here-----------------
The new user Logon looks now like this Example:

        ATTENTION: This is a totally closed Bulletin Board System.
        If you wanna Access here, so Answer the following Questions
        very Accuratly. May then you will receive an Account here !.
                                da staff...


 You know the NewUserPassword? (y/N) >: n ( <-' )

 Please enter your Handle >:

If he enters no then the user have to enter his handle...
After this the Doors checks in the File Name.no is there the name in then
the user will disconnected from the BBS with a nice message... hehe
If not so then your Script (NupCom.cfg) will executed.
After filling out the Questions the User will disconnected from your BBS.
And you have no dead or unlike Accounts in your User.data.
You can free decide if you let the User in or not...

Now you can call from your BBS the Command NupCom and can handle all New
Users Answers many easy from the NupCom Server...

This is all what you have to do...

@endnode
