                    This is the Main menu from the Door

1. View New User Answer File
2. Move New user answer File to validated User Directory...
3. Restrict User from your BBS (Name.no File)
4. Edit names.no File
5. View Answerfile from already Validated Users
6. Delete Answer File
Q. Exit the Door
